var e=[{id:`lead-1`,name:`Marcus Sterling`,designation:`Managing Director & Chief Executive`,department:`Executive Board`,experience:`22+ Years Enterprise Systems & International Governance`,education:`M.Sc. Computer Engineering, Imperial College London`,bio:`Marcus directs A8Fusion’s strategic international expansion and sovereign technology advisory. Prior to leading A8Fusion, he steered major digital architecture initiatives across Europe, the Middle East, and Southeast Asia, specializing in high-concurrency public systems.`,philosophy:`Enterprise engineering is founded on accountability and zero compromise on architectural integrity. True digital transformation is measured by organizational resilience under stress, not superficial digital veneers.`,focus:`Global Market Expansion, Sovereign Technology Governance, Strategic Enterprise Partnerships`,linkedin:`https://linkedin.com/company/a8fusion`,image:`https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80`},{id:`lead-2`,name:`Dr. Evelyn Chen`,designation:`Chief Technology Officer & Head of Architecture`,department:`Engineering & Technology`,experience:`18+ Years Distributed Systems & Cryptographic Security`,education:`Ph.D. in Computer Science, National University of Singapore`,bio:`Dr. Chen oversees A8Fusion’s engineering standards, platform kernel development, and enterprise AI research. Her academic and industrial background in distributed consensus and deterministic systems informs our zero-trust engineering culture.`,philosophy:`Complexity is the enemy of security and performance. We build elegant, decoupled primitives that allow institutions to scale fearlessly without accumulating catastrophic technical debt.`,focus:`Enterprise Micro-Architectures, Private LLM Frameworks, High-Availability Cloud Infrastructure`,linkedin:`https://linkedin.com/company/a8fusion`,image:`https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573496359142-b8d87734a5a2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80`},{id:`lead-3`,name:`Tariq Al-Mansoor`,designation:`Senior Vice President – Government & Public Sector`,department:`Sovereign Solutions`,experience:`19+ Years Civic Digital Transformation & Public Policy Systems`,education:`B.Eng. Software Systems, University of Manchester`,bio:`Tariq heads our public sector engagement practice, counseling municipal authorities and state bodies on e-governance implementation, sovereign data residency, and national digital infrastructure modernization.`,philosophy:`Public technology is civic trust materialized in code. Every government portal must be accessible to every citizen, impervious to compromise, and audit-ready at all times.`,focus:`E-Governance Portals, Smart City Infrastructure, Sovereign Data Compliance`,linkedin:`https://linkedin.com/company/a8fusion`,image:`https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507003211169-0a1dd7228f2d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80`},{id:`lead-4`,name:`Sophia Arisandi`,designation:`Vice President – Global Delivery & Client Operations`,department:`Operations & Delivery`,experience:`16+ Years Large-Scale Enterprise Delivery & Systems Integration`,education:`B.Sc. Information Systems, Melbourne Business School`,bio:`Sophia manages A8Fusion’s international delivery centers and multi-disciplinary engineering squads. She ensures seamless milestone execution, transparent SLA tracking, and rigorous quality assurance across all client deployments.`,philosophy:`Predictability in delivery is what distinguishes elite engineering firms. We operate with radical transparency, milestone documentation, and unwavering operational discipline.`,focus:`Multi-Region Agile Delivery, Quality Assurance Governance, SLA Enforcement`,linkedin:`https://linkedin.com/company/a8fusion`,image:`https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580489944761-15a19d654956?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80`}],t=[{title:`Architectural Transparency`,desc:`Every system we construct is backed by comprehensive Architecture Decision Records (ADRs), complete source code traceability, and zero hidden proprietary traps.`},{title:`Zero Vendor Lock-In`,desc:`We leverage open industry standards, standard SQL schemas, and containerized deployments, guaranteeing clients full autonomy over their digital assets.`},{title:`Sovereignty & Compliance`,desc:`Client data residency and statutory compliance supersede convenience. We adhere strictly to local sovereign regulations, GDPR, and international security standards.`},{title:`Independent Technical Integrity`,desc:`Our engineering recommendations are free of commercial software kickbacks or commissioned vendor incentives, preserving uncompromised fiduciary counsel.`}];export{e as n,t};